                "page_start": 158,
                "paraphrased": false,
                "text_excerpt": "Any claim that social scientific theory--other than common sense--is required to find the essentials of the Rodgers and Maranto model is clearly false."
              },
              "statement": "Social scientific theory beyond common sense is not required to find the essentials of the Rodgers and Maranto model."
