                "page_start": 158,
                "paraphrased": false,
                "text_excerpt": "If the search procedure is repeated using .05 as the significance level, the program deletes the PREPROD -> PUBS edge. When that model is estimated and tested with the EQS program we find that χ2 is 19.2 with 12 degrees of freedom and a p value of .08"
